=2 Walkthrough
* You cannot start this quest if you have another {q:Weapon Skill Quest|WSNM|Weapon Skill Quest} active. You must return to the person that gave said quest and quit it to start another.

* Speaking with {p:Gumbah} will grant you the key item {k:Weapon training guide} as well as the {p:Sword of Trials}. You will need to break the latent on the {p:Sword of Trials} before completing the rest of the quest.

:* Breaking the Latent

::* With the {p:Sword of Trials} equipped in your Main hand, fight experience-yielding mobs ("Incredibly Easy Prey" or higher) and perform {p:Weapon Skills|Category:Weapon Skills} or close {p:Skillchains|Category:Skillchain} to accumulate 300 "Trial Points".

|^Skillchain Level|Points
|No Skillchain|5
|Level 1|7
|Level 2|9
|Level 3|11

::* You know you have enough points when the latent breaks. You will know it is done when the weapon's elemental resistances disappear from your active resistances (colored dots below the gear grid, but above the selected item description). **The item's description text will never change**.

!Broken Latent.png||
* Trade the {p:Sword of Trials} back to {p:Gumbah}. This will give you the key item {k:Map to the Annals of Truth}.
* Next, travel to the oasis in **{z:Western Altepa Desert} at **(E-9). It is located in the south west of the map.
** {p:Unity Warp} (125) gets you closest.
** {z:Rabao} or {z:Quicksand Caves} #1 HP warps, {p:Survival Guide}, or {p:Voidwatch} warps also available.
* Examine the ??? on the south side of the oasis to spawn the NM {m:Maharaja}, a tiger.
* Re-examine the ??? after winning to receive the key item {k:Annals of Truth}.
* Go back and speak with {p:Gumbah} to receive your reward.

